			<div class="content" id="post-content-4137620">
									

<p>My entry to the 2019 Cliche Contest! This is my first solo skip and by far the most ambitious piece of writing I've ever done. I wanted to explore how science is done in the foundation: Endless cross-tests never answer the questions at the core of the anomaly. I wanted to show how Foundation scientists would go about answering these questions, and what happens when there isn't a single clear result. I'm really proud to have created this and I couldn't have done it without the help of these awesome people:</p>
